  "details": "I keep running into a problem where certain gestures for facial expressions cannot be locked because moving the thumb stick over to select the option ruins it. \n\nFor example, my eyes closed is double finger guns. But as soon as I put my thumb on the stick to lock the gesture via radial menu, it changes. \n\nI’d like to see this resolved with a countdown similar to the camera! Give it 5 seconds so the user can start it, set their preferred expression, and then lock it. :)",
